config BR2_PACKAGE_SK18_WIFI_FIRMWARE
	bool "sk18-wifi-firmware"
	help
	  Firmware of the RTL8188GU (RTL8710BU) USB Wi-Fi adapter used with
	  the Waveshare SK-18: rtlwifi/rtl8710bufw_SMIC.bin and
	  rtl8710bufw_UMC.bin, which the rtl8xxxu driver loads.

	  Only these two files and their licence are downloaded, from the
	  same linux-firmware release as Buildroot's own linux-firmware
	  package, not the whole firmware tree. The firmware is Realtek's
	  and is redistributable in binary form under the licence installed
	  with it (/usr/share/doc/sk18-wifi-firmware).
